        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 247.53,
          "end": 249.18,
          "en": "which we can await here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 249.18,
          "end": 252.18,
          "en": "because I'm using the async keyword here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 252.18,
          "end": 256.64,
          "en": "And then ultimately we'll therefore get our meetups here.",
